"""
Redlining Simulation v1.0
- Interactive single-student simulation with branching storylines
- Records every move and produces a per-student summary
- Optional neighborhood map (PNG via matplotlib or ASCII fallback)
- Optional PDF export (reportlab) or plain text export
- Classroom dashboard to run N simulations and export CSV for grading/comparison

Optional dependencies (for extra features):
    pip install reportlab matplotlib pandas
"""

